channels":["global-channel","forex-channel","us-stock-channel","a-stock-channel","xgb-channel","commodity-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e芝商所小麦价格连续第二日上涨，创下自11月以来最高水平。美国平原地区持续干旱影响供应前景，全球地缘政治紧张局势加剧了对潜在供应中断的担忧。美国农业部周三报告称，预计美国中南部平原地区将出现高温和阵风天气，该地区是冬小麦的主要产区。目前该区域已有多处野火肆虐。芝加哥基准期货价格一度上涨1.7%，延续周三1.8%的涨幅，盘中触及11月19日以来最高。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"芝商所小麦价格连续第二日上涨，创下自11月以来最高水平。美国平原地区持续干旱影响供应前景，全球地缘政治紧张局势加剧了对潜在供应中断的担忧。美国农业部周三报告称，预计美国中南部平原地区将出现高温和阵风天气，该地区是冬小麦的主要产区。目前该区域已有多处野火肆虐。芝加哥基准期货价格一度上涨1.7%，延续周三1.8%的涨幅，盘中触及11月19日以来最高。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1771508116,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3056649,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"芝商所小麦价格触及三个月高点，受美国干旱与地缘政治紧张局势推动","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3056649"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/478b50b9-9fd3-4275-afc0-f1f5e83cbf37","display_name":"葛冬瑾","id":120000004519,"is_followed":false,"uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/authors/120000004519"},"ban_comment":false,"channels":["global-channel","forex-channel","us-stock-channel"],"comment_count":0,"content":"\u003cp\u003e摩根士丹利将客户交易非上市公司股份的收费下调一半。\u003c/p\u003e\n","content_more":"","content_text":"摩根士丹利将客户交易非上市公司股份的收费下调一半。","cover_images":[],"display_time":1771508045,"fund_codes":[],"global_channel_name":"7x24快讯","global_more_uri":"wscn://wallstreetcn.com/live","has_live_reading":false,"highlight_title":"","id":3056648,"images":[],"is_calendar":false,"is_favourite":false,"is_priced":false,"is_scaling":false,"reference":"","related_themes":[],"score":1,"symbols":[],"tags":[],"title":"","type":"live","uri":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3056648"},{"article":null,"author":{"avatar":"https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/478b50b9-9fd3-4275-afc0-f1f5e8